      en: ["Established in 1958", "Nominal capacity of 6.5 million tons per year", "Produces over 60 types of petroleum products", "Major producer of lubricating oils in Uzbekistan", "Underwent significant modernization in the 1990s", "Strategic supplier for the Fergana Valley region"],
      es: ["Construcción: 1958", "Capacidad: 5 millones de t/año", "Productos: gasolina, diésel, lubricantes", "Fuente de crudo: cuenca de Ferganá", "Empleados: 2.500", "Modernización: 2010"],
