      en: ["Established in 1944 during World War II", "Official name: Uzmetkombinat", "Processes 90% of Uzbekistan's scrap metal", "Capacity of over 1 million tons of steel annually", "Located on the banks of the Syr Darya River", "The only integrated steel manufacturer in the country"],
